From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Marc Lainez <marc.lainez@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 00:46:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 24/28] video: simplefb: initialise the rotation

Without a "rot" property the rotation was left uninitialised and used to
pick the console driver, e.g. "vidconsole4940".

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---
 drivers/video/simplefb.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/video/simplefb.c b/drivers/video/simplefb.c
index 631ae00b..c514cac3 100644
--- a/drivers/video/simplefb.c
+++ b/drivers/video/simplefb.c
@@ -21,7 +21,7 @@ static int simple_video_probe(struct udevice *dev)
 	int ret;
 	fdt_addr_t base;
 	fdt_size_t size;
-	u32 width, height, stride, rot;
+	u32 width, height, stride, rot = 0;
 	struct ofnode_phandle_args args;
 
 	ret = dev_read_phandle_with_args(dev, "memory-region", NULL, 0, 0, &args);
